Z||000000||DRH||12-23-1999||12:15 PM||||I found this posted on another site (dated 12/20/1999). I'm WAY too far away. Maybe someone closer would like to check into rescuing it. The posters email is leroyboy@home.com<P><BR>I know where there is a complete Indy Pace car Fiero sitting in a salvage yard in Southern New Jersey. The car is complete. The windshield is smashed, but as of yesterday, the body was nearly perfect. I would say that it needs the windshield & a good detailing. I hate to see one go to the crusher, so if anyone is interested, email me & I will give directions to the yard. p.s. The yard is only open on Saturdays & Sundays & is run by a 90plus year old man. There is no phone to call him, you would just have to show up there & work something out with him.||||reg||1
